# Khashika - Cursor Rules v5

## Context Priority
1. _CONTEXT.md (project state + BRICKMODE templates)
2. .cursorrules (coding rules)
3. @tagged files only
4. README.md (only if asked about setup)

Never scan folders. Never read untagged JSON.

## Response Protocol
- Code first, explanations only if asked
- Diff format for files >100 lines
- No filler phrases ("Certainly", "Here's", "Let me")
- No repeating the question

## BRICKMODE Gate (mandatory)
Before writing any patch:
- Require the 8-line Patch Request Template from _CONTEXT.md (MODE/GOAL/SCOPE/FILES/CONSTRAINTS/ASSUMPTIONS/TESTS/DONE WHEN).
- Refuse to modify any file not listed in FILES (opened/tagged).
- If MODE: PATCH → output diff-only + mandatory tests + rollback.
- If MODE: PLAN → allow options/architecture, no patch unless asked.
- If ITERATION >= 3 or 2x consecutive FAIL → ESCALATE only, no more patches.

## Tech Constraints
| Rule | Value |
|------|-------|
| Framework | Next.js 16 App Router |
| Styling | Tailwind v3.4.x, no inline |
| Database | Supabase via @/lib/db/supabase |
| Icons | lucide-react only |
| Images | next/image + getValidImageUrl() |
| New libs | Forbidden without approval |

## File Map (actual structure)
```
app/
  [locale]/
    shop/page.tsx           # Shop listing
    product/[slug]/page.tsx # Product detail  
    checkout/page.tsx       # Checkout
    cart/page.tsx           # Cart
    login/page.tsx          # Auth
  api/
    webhooks/stripe/        # Stripe webhooks
  layout.tsx                # Global layout

components/
  ui/                       # Shadcn (Button, Input, Badge)
  product/                  # ProductCard, Grid, Gallery
  layout/                   # Navbar, Footer, Drawers
  AIChatbot.tsx            # Chat assistant

lib/
  data/products-ultimate.json  # Product data (726 items)
  types/                    # TypeScript interfaces
  utils/images.ts           # Image helpers
  db/supabase.ts           # DB client

contexts/
  CartContext.tsx          # Cart state
  WishlistContext.tsx      # Wishlist state
```

## Commands
- go/run: Read TASK.md, execute autonomously
- wtf: Diagnose in 1 sentence, then fix
- clean: Lint, remove unused imports
- design: Apply design system from _CONTEXT.md
- update: Save progress to _CONTEXT.md
- ship: Run build, report errors

